:INFO
Art. 1 Reciprocal rights
(Art. 6 paras. 2 and 3 as well as 52 para. 2 of the PPA)
1 The State Secretariat for Economic Affairs (SECO) shall keep a list of the countries that have undertaken to grant market access to Switzerland.
2 It shall be published on the internet platform for public procurement operated by the Confederation and the cantons.
3 SECO shall answer questions on the commitments entered into.
|

:NOTE
Para. 2 — www.simap.ch
|

:INFO
Art. 2 Exemption from the PPA
(Art. 7 of the PPA)
1 The sectoral markets listed in Annex 1 are exempt from the PPA.
2 Proposals for the exemption of other sectoral markets must be submitted to the Federal Department of the Environment, Transport, Energy and Communications (DETEC).
3 If DETEC considers the conditions for exemption to be fulfilled, it shall submit a proposal for an amendment to Annex 1 to the Federal Council.

